"""Reviewed bilingual prose; numbers and detailed result tables live in shared evidence.

Presentation only. This module does not execute experiments or alter contracts.
Each tuple is (Chinese, English). Old prose remains in byte-preserved archives.
"""
PAGES = {}
def page(name, title, purpose, paragraphs, links=()):
    PAGES[name] = dict(title=title, purpose=purpose, paragraphs=paragraphs, links=links)

page('README', ('项目概览','Project overview'),
 ('这个项目研究 Android Chrome 上的 WebGPU 模型观察与矩阵乘法实现。阅读时请先分清原题目标、补充实验和实际完成范围。','This project studies model observation and matrix multiplication in Android Chrome with WebGPU. Separate the assignment target, supplemental experiments, and the scope actually demonstrated.'), [
 ('整体状态是 PARTIAL。Part 1 使用固定 MediaPipe runtime 运行 Gemma 3n E2B Web 模型；Part 2 使用自写 WGSL 比较合成 Q4/Q8 权重的 FP16 A–D 实现。二者不是同一个运行管线，独立 kernel 收益不证明模型加速。','Overall status is PARTIAL. Part 1 runs the Gemma 3n E2B Web model with a fixed MediaPipe runtime. Part 2 compares custom WGSL FP16 implementations A–D using synthetic Q4/Q8 weights. These are separate execution paths; an isolated kernel improvement does not demonstrate model acceleration.'),
 ('已取得三种完整 prompt 长度各五次模型会话，以及 Part 2 五次独立复验。实测设备为 Mali；原题目标 Adreno 未测。真实输出 token、纯 prefill/decode、可信 kernel breakdown 和五次进程内存重复仍缺失。','There are five model sessions at each of three full-prompt lengths and five independent Part 2 repeat sessions. Measurements used Mali; the assignment target Adreno has not been tested. Actual generated tokens, isolated prefill/decode, a trustworthy kernel breakdown, and five process-memory repetitions remain missing.')],
 ['reading_guide','assignment_requirements_matrix','reproduction','environment'])

page('reading_guide', ('项目阅读指南','Reading guide'),
 ('本指南面向懂基本编程和计算机体系结构、但没做过此项目的读者。先用小矩阵理解映射，再读精度和测量契约。','This guide assumes basic programming and computer architecture knowledge, but no prior familiarity with this project. Start with a small matrix mapping, then read the precision and measurement contracts.'), [
 ('初学路线：项目概览 → 下方小矩阵示例 → CPU/JavaScript 与 GPU/WGSL 分工 → naive → QROW 与 FP16 契约 → B/C/D → 测量契约 → 五轮结果 → Part 1 模型观察。审阅路线：当前报告 → 原题要求矩阵 → 两份契约 → 结果文档 → 原始证据及核验 → 复现说明。','Beginner route: overview → the small matrix below → CPU/JavaScript versus GPU/WGSL responsibilities → naive → QROW and FP16 contract → B/C/D → measurement contract → repeat results → Part 1 model observations. Reviewer route: current report → assignment matrix → both contracts → results → raw evidence and verification → reproduction.'),
 ('设矩阵 A=[[1,2,3],[4,5,6]]，B=[[7,8],[9,10],[11,12]]，则 M=2、K=3、N=2，C=[[58,64],[139,154]]。这是帮助读代码的示例，不是新增手机实验。row-major 将一行连续存放，因此 A[row*K+k] 与 B[k*N+column] 相乘，结果写 C[row*N+column]。','Let matrix A=[[1,2,3],[4,5,6]] and B=[[7,8],[9,10],[11,12]]. Then M=2, K=3, N=2, and C=[[58,64],[139,154]]. This is a code-reading example, not a new phone experiment. Row-major storage places each row contiguously: multiply A[row*K+k] by B[k*N+column] and store C[row*N+column].'),
 ('gemm_naive.wgsl 的 main 使用 global_invocation_id.x 作为列、y 作为行。一个 8×8 工作组包含 64 个 invocation（一次 shader 调用）；本示例仅 (列,行)=(0,0),(1,0),(0,1),(1,1) 写四个结果，其余由边界分支返回。这个 naive shader 没有 barrier，因此提前返回合法。带共享存储和 barrier 的 B/C/D 必须让所有 invocation 参与同步，越界输出也不能跳过 barrier。','The main function in gemm_naive.wgsl uses global_invocation_id.x as the column and y as the row. An 8×8 workgroup contains 64 invocations (shader executions). In this example, only (column,row)=(0,0),(1,0),(0,1),(1,1) write the four outputs; the remaining invocations return at the bounds check. This naive shader has no barrier, so returning early is safe. B/C/D use shared storage and barriers; all invocations must participate in synchronization, including those outside the output bounds.'),
 ('JavaScript 负责生成输入、独立 CPU reference、创建 buffer/pipeline、编码并提交 GPU 命令、读回和验证。WGSL 负责 GPU 上的数值运算。gemm_math.mjs 是 FP32 工具；part2_math.mjs 的 verify 检查冻结的精度标准；sessions.js 的 runSession 是模型会话入口。这些入口的源码链接见下方。','JavaScript generates inputs and independent CPU references, creates buffers and pipelines, encodes and submits GPU commands, and reads back and validates results. WGSL performs GPU arithmetic. gemm_math.mjs provides FP32 tools; verify in part2_math.mjs checks the frozen precision criteria; runSession in sessions.js is the model-session entry point. Source links appear below.'),
 ('不要混淆矩阵 A/B/C 与版本 A/B/C/D：矩阵是输入及输出，版本是四种实现。版本 C 每个 invocation 处理四个相邻输出列；其原配置工作组为 8×8，共 64 个 invocation，输出 tile 却是 8 行×32 列。名称 C-8x8-K16 中 8×8 指工作组，K16 指归约分块。','Do not confuse matrices A/B/C with implementations A/B/C/D. Matrices are operands and the result; implementations are four algorithms. Implementation C computes four neighboring output columns per invocation. Its original workgroup is 8×8 (64 invocations), while its output tile is 8 rows by 32 columns. In C-8x8-K16, 8×8 names the workgroup and K16 names the reduction chunk.')],
 ['glossary','part2_compute_contract','part2_vectorized_c','measurement_contract','part2_repeat_results','baseline_sessions_results','reproduction'])

page('glossary', ('术语表','Glossary'),
 ('术语用于说明本仓库实际实现，不用于推断底层硬件指令或模型内部结构。','These terms describe the repository implementation, not inferred hardware instructions or internal model structure.'), [
 ('GEMM 是矩阵乘法：A[M,K]×B[K,N]→C[M,N]。M 为输出行数，N 为输出列数，K 为归约长度。row-major（行优先）表示同一行的元素连续。invocation 是一次 shader 调用；工作组（workgroup）是一组可共享组内存储并同步的 invocation；dispatch 是向 GPU 提交一组工作组的命令。','GEMM is matrix multiplication: A[M,K]×B[K,N]→C[M,N]. M is the output row count, N the output column count, and K the reduction length. Row-major means consecutive elements of a row are adjacent. An invocation is one shader execution. A workgroup is a set of invocations that can share workgroup storage and synchronize. A dispatch launches a grid of workgroups.'),
 ('tile 是分块；输出 tile 与 K 归约 tile 不同。barrier 是工作组内同步点。vectorized 指此处用 vec4 加载和处理四个相邻输出，并不证明硬件执行 vec4 指令。packed 指多个低位宽整数装入一个 u32。量化将数值表示为整数和元数据；反量化按 (q-zeroPoint)*scale 恢复近似值。','A tile is a block; an output tile differs from a K-reduction tile. A barrier synchronizes a workgroup. Here, vectorized means vec4 loads and operations on four neighboring outputs; it does not prove a hardware vector instruction. Packed means multiple low-bit-width codes stored in one u32. Quantization represents values with integer codes and metadata; dequantization reconstructs an approximation using (q-zeroPoint)*scale.'),
 ('FP16 storage 表示二进制16位存储；FP16 multiplication 表示乘法的类型/精度；FP16 accumulation 表示每步累加保持 FP16 语义。这三件事不能互相替代。本项目输出数值为 FP16，但读回容器是 f32。','FP16 storage is a binary16 representation. FP16 multiplication concerns the arithmetic type and precision. FP16 accumulation maintains FP16 semantics at each accumulation step. These are distinct. This project stores the final FP16 numerical value in an f32 readback carrier.'),
 ('median 是排序后的中位数；偶数样本取中间两值的平均。nearest-rank p95 取排序后第 ceil(0.95*n) 个值，30 样本取第 29 个，五次会话取最大值。65.536 µs 是观察到的时间戳网格，不是 kernel 固定成本。两个 median 相差不超过一个网格时暂不能区分。','Median is the middle sorted value, averaging the two middle values for an even sample count. Nearest-rank p95 selects rank ceil(0.95*n): rank 29 for 30 samples, and the maximum for five sessions. The observed timestamp grid is 65.536 µs, not a fixed kernel cost. Median differences within one grid are treated as unresolved.'),
 ('logical bytes 是 API 资源的账面大小；RSS 是进程驻留页，跨进程相加可重复计算共享页；PSS 按共享比例分摊，但也不是模型独占内存。UNKNOWN 是未知；UNAVAILABLE 是当前证据不能核算；NOT_MEASURED 是没有测量。','Logical bytes are an API-resource accounting quantity. RSS measures process resident pages and can double-count shared pages across processes. PSS apportions shared pages, but is not model-exclusive memory. UNKNOWN means unknown; UNAVAILABLE means the evidence cannot support accounting; NOT_MEASURED means not measured.')], ['measurement_contract','memory001_texture_accounting'])

page('measurement_contract', ('测量契约与统计解释','Measurement contract and statistical interpretation'),
 ('本文件解释冻结的测量边界。早期计划的样本预算与后来实际执行的预算分开，不能用计划替代原始记录。','This document explains the frozen measurement boundaries. Early proposed budgets are distinct from the budgets actually executed; a plan does not replace raw evidence.'), [
 ('kernel-only 测量 compute pass 的开始与结束时间戳；pipeline 创建、分配、输入上传、reference、输出读回和 CPU 检查在区间外。submit-to-completion 墙钟从 queue.submit 前到 onSubmittedWorkDone 完成，包含队列等待等主机可见成本，不等于 GPU 算术时间。','Kernel-only measures timestamps at compute-pass beginning and end. Pipeline creation, allocation, upload, references, output readback, and CPU checks are outside the interval. Submit-to-completion wall time starts immediately before queue.submit and ends at onSubmittedWorkDone, including host-visible queue delays; it is not GPU arithmetic time.'),
 ('完整路径 pilot 从共同 packed 输入开始，实际重新执行 CPU 反量化、布局转换、必要上传，到最终 GPU 完成；它独立采样，不由准备 median 与 kernel median 相加。共同初始上传可排除，但必须记录。静态权重只准备一次并复用是另一场景，不能套用每次准备的收益。','The full-path pilot starts from common packed inputs and actually repeats CPU dequantization, layout conversion, and required upload through final GPU completion. It is sampled independently, not constructed by adding preparation and kernel medians. Common initial uploads may be excluded if documented. Preparing static weights once for reuse is a different scenario.'),
 ('当前受控 GEMM、sweep 与 repeat 使用每配置 10 次 warm-up 和 30 次 measured，单 pass 单 dispatch，串行完成并全量读回校验。早期提出的 20/100 预算仅是历史计划。TIMING001 的 32-dispatch pass 不除以 32 后当独立 latency。','Current controlled GEMM, sweep, and repeat experiments use 10 warm-up and 30 measured passes per configuration, one dispatch per pass, serial completion, and full output validation. The earlier proposed 20/100 budget remains a historical plan. A TIMING001 32-dispatch pass is not divided by 32 and called independent latency.'),
 ('时间戳用 BigUint64Array 读回，先 BigInt 相减，再转换单位；JSON 保存十进制字符串。保留零值和长尾。median、nearest-rank p95、min/max、零值数分别报告。五次独立会话每次创建新的页面/device；不是把一次会话 150 样本切成五组，也不只合并后给一个 median。','Timestamps are read with BigUint64Array, subtracted as BigInt, then converted to units. JSON preserves decimal strings. Zeros and tails are retained. Median, nearest-rank p95, min/max, and zero counts are reported separately. Five independent sessions each create a fresh page/device; they are neither partitions of one session nor summarized solely by a pooled median.'),
 ('比值必须来自同轮、同口径：A median/候选 median 表示相对 A；原配置 median/选定配置 median 表示相对自身。后者大于 1 不保证前者大于 1。网格内差异保留不确定状态，不能宣称稳定收益。串行等待和读回会改变运行状态，因此这些是受控 kernel 实验，而不是 stock 模型吞吐。','Ratios use the same session and scope: A median/candidate median compares against A; original median/selected median compares a variant against itself. Improving over itself does not guarantee beating A. Grid-scale differences remain uncertain. Serial waits and readback affect execution conditions, so these are controlled kernel experiments, not stock model throughput.'),
 ('PROFILE003 和 TIMING002 存在相邻时间区间重叠。当前证据不能支持独占 kernel 排名或可加和 breakdown；不裁剪、不均分、不把区间 union 称为物理 GPU busy time。','PROFILE003 and TIMING002 show overlapping neighboring timestamp intervals. The evidence does not support exclusive kernel rankings or additive breakdowns. Intervals are not clipped or equally divided, and their union is not physical GPU busy time.')], ['timestamp_validity','part2_repeat_plan','reproduction'])

page('part2_compute_contract', ('Part 2 计算契约','Part 2 compute contract'),
 ('冻结版本为 PART2-QROW-v1。原题第 2 页要求 Q4/Q8 → 反量化 → GEMM → FP16 accumulation；A 为 naive，B 为共享存储 tiled，C 为 vectorized loads，D 为 fused dequant + GEMM。下面未由原题指定的格式是项目实验选择。','The frozen version is PART2-QROW-v1. Assignment page 2 requires Q4/Q8 → dequantization → GEMM → FP16 accumulation: A is naive, B shared-memory tiled, C vectorized loads, and D fused dequantization plus GEMM. Format details not specified by the assignment are project choices.'), [
 ('计算 C[m,n]=sum_k A[m,k]*B[k,n]，A[M,K]、Q[K,N]、C[M,N] 均行优先。不转置、不含 bias/activation、不折叠 batch/head。性能 shape 为代表性 M=1/128、K=N=1024；不是已确认的真实有效模型层。GEMM004 的 M=8,K=1536,N=2048 仅是执行/padded shape 补充。','Compute C[m,n]=sum_k A[m,k]*B[k,n], with row-major A[M,K], Q[K,N], and C[M,N]. There is no transpose, bias, activation, or batch/head folding. Performance shapes M=1/128 and K=N=1024 are representative, not confirmed effective logical model layers. GEMM004 M=8,K=1536,N=2048 is only an execution/padded-shape supplement.'),
 ('QROW 是合成 unsigned Q4（0..15）或 Q8（0..255），不是 Gemma 原生格式。每 u32 装 32/bits 个相邻 N 元素，低位先放，shift=bits*(n mod (32/bits))；word 索引 k*ceil(N/(32/bits))+floor(n/(32/bits))。每行独立，尾部高位补零，不跨行 packing。整数 q 本身不做符号扩展；负权重来自 q-zeroPoint。','QROW is synthetic unsigned Q4 (0..15) or Q8 (0..255), not Gemma native storage. Each u32 holds 32/bits adjacent N codes, least significant first, with shift=bits*(n mod (32/bits)). The word index is k*ceil(N/(32/bits))+floor(n/(32/bits)). Rows are packed separately with zero-filled high tail bits. Codes are not sign-extended; negative weights arise from q-zeroPoint.'),
 ('group size=32，沿 K 分组、每输出列独立。scale 和 zeroPoint 索引 floor(k/32)*N+n，形状 [ceil(K/32),N]；scale 保存 binary16，zeroPoint 保存 u32。短 K 尾组只处理有效元素。B16=RN16((int(q)-int(zp))*decodeHalf(scale))；先整数相减，再乘实际存储 scale，再按 ties-to-even 转 FP16。','Group size is 32 along K, separately per output column. Scale and zero-point use index floor(k/32)*N+n and shape [ceil(K/32),N]. Scale is stored as binary16 and zero-point as u32. The final partial K group processes only valid elements. B16=RN16((int(q)-int(zp))*decodeHalf(scale)): integer subtraction, multiplication by the stored scale, then ties-to-even conversion to FP16.'),
 ('activation 保存 binary16。所有版本按递增 K 使用 f16 accumulator 和显式 fma；C/D 四个分量各自保持同样顺序，不用 dot 改变归约。输出数值为 binary16，写入 f32 carrier 后读回。WGSL 允许的融合和 subnormal 行为可能与 canonical CPU 模拟不同；不承诺一般输入逐位一致，也不把 shader-f16 feature 等同于实测累加路径。','Activations are stored as binary16. All variants use an f16 accumulator and explicit fma in increasing K order. C/D retain this order independently for each of four components; they do not use dot to change the reduction. The result is a binary16 numerical value written into an f32 carrier for readback. Permitted WGSL fusion and subnormal behavior may differ from the canonical CPU model. General bitwise equality is not promised, and shader-f16 support alone does not validate accumulation.'),
 ('固定 xorshift32 种子 0x2ab00117。精确族 A=-1/0/1、scale=1、q 在 zeroPoint 附近；非整数族 A 为 [-16,16]/64，Q4 scale=1/32，Q8 scale=1/512，zeroPoint 为中点附近。输入先转实际存储精度。K 上限 1024，不在失败后缩小范围。FP16 区分用例输出 2048，而 FP32/high reference 为 2050。','The fixed xorshift32 seed is 0x2ab00117. The exact family uses A=-1/0/1, scale=1, and codes near the zero-point. Fractional inputs use A in [-16,16]/64, Q4 scale=1/32, Q8 scale=1/512, and zero-points near the midpoint. Inputs are converted to their actual storage precision first. K is bounded at 1024 and is not reduced after failure. The FP16 discriminator produces 2048 while FP32/high references produce 2050.'),
 ('独立 reference 包含 binary64 数学累加、canonical RN-even FP16 每步 fma，以及逐步 FP32 oracle。精确用例 atol=rtol=0；非整数语义 atol=0.02、rtol=0.01；high/FP32 atol=rtol=0.04；relative 分母下限 1e-8。FP32 fallback 为 0.0002/0.0002，另报不算规定路径。区分 probe 单独允许误差 2；不用于一般用例。逐元素条件为 abs(error)<=atol+rtol*abs(reference)，另查非有限值。','Independent references include binary64 mathematical accumulation, canonical RN-even FP16 fma at each step, and sequential FP32 accumulation. Exact cases use atol=rtol=0. Fractional semantic tolerances are atol=0.02, rtol=0.01; high/FP32 tolerances are 0.04/0.04. The relative-error denominator floor is 1e-8. FP32 fallback uses 0.0002/0.0002 and is reported separately. The discriminator alone permits error 2, not general cases. Element acceptance uses abs(error)<=atol+rtol*abs(reference), with separate nonfinite checks.'),
 ('A/B/C 从同一 packed 输入预反量化；C 还将 B16 补齐为 vec4 布局。D 在 shader 内解包、反量化，不创建完整 B16 中间矩阵。A/B 使用 16-byte uniform [M,N,K,0]；C/D 的扩展参数以实际源码为准。所有 buffer 按 WebGPU 对齐与 device limits 检查；不支持时明确记录，不静默改 tile。','A/B/C pre-dequantize the same packed input; C additionally pads B16 to a vec4 layout. D unpacks and dequantizes inside the shader without allocating the complete B16 intermediate. A/B use a 16-byte uniform [M,N,K,0]; C/D extended parameters follow their actual source. Buffers are checked against WebGPU alignment and device limits. Unsupported configurations are recorded rather than silently changing the tile.')], ['part2_vectorized_c','part2_fused_d','part2_q8','measurement_contract'])

page('part2_vectorized_c', ('版本 C：向量化 tiled GEMM','Implementation C: vectorized tiled GEMM'),
 ('本文件解释 C 相对 A/B 的具体源码变化，而不是宣称 vec4 一定更快。','This document explains the source changes in C relative to A/B, rather than assuming vec4 must be faster.'), [
 ('原配置 C-8x8-K16 使用 8×8 invocation，每个计算四个相邻输出列，输出 tile 为 8×32，K tile 为 16。共享 A 为 8×16 个 f16，共享 B 为 16×8 个 vec4<f16>，合计 1280 bytes。加载后和使用后各一次 barrier；尾部补零，最终按列逐分量检查 store。','Original C-8x8-K16 uses 8×8 invocations, four neighboring output columns per invocation, an 8×32 output tile, and K chunks of 16. Shared A contains 8×16 f16 values; shared B contains 16×8 vec4<f16> values, totaling 1280 bytes. Barriers occur after loading and after use. Tail loads are zero-filled and final stores check each output component.'),
 ('CPU 准备 C 的 vec4 B16 布局，row stride 为 ceil(N/4)，额外 padding 和转换资源单独记录。各分量仍按递增 K 执行 f16 fma；没有改变归约顺序。源码同时改变输出映射、加载和每线程工作量，不能把观察归因为单一硬件向量指令。','CPU preparation forms a vec4 B16 layout with row stride ceil(N/4). Padding and conversion resources are recorded separately. Each component still performs f16 fma in increasing K order. The source changes output mapping, loads, and per-thread work together, so observations cannot be attributed solely to hardware vector instructions.'),
 ('手机 A/B/C pilot 已通过当前合成契约，五轮复验见结果文档。Q8、fused D 后来分别接入；历史 NOT_RUN 是实现准备时的状态。M=1 A/C 的网格内差异和跨轮方向变化保留，不认定稳定小幅收益。','The phone A/B/C pilot passed the synthetic contract; repeat results are documented separately. Q8 and fused D were added later. Historical NOT_RUN labels describe preparation time. Grid-scale M=1 A/C differences and cross-session reversals are retained, not described as stable small gains.')], ['part2_compute_contract','part2_repeat_results'])

page('part2_fused_d', ('版本 D：融合反量化及两种计时口径','Implementation D: fused dequantization and two timing scopes'),
 ('D 直接使用 packed QROW、scale 和 zeroPoint。需要先了解 C 的 vec4 输出映射及冻结反量化顺序。','D directly consumes packed QROW, scales, and zero-points. Read the C vec4 output mapping and frozen dequantization order first.'), [
 ('D 沿用 C 的工作组和四列输出映射，在加载 B tile 时读取 u32 code、移位掩码、整数减 zeroPoint、乘 scale、转 f16，然后进入同样的递增 K fma。没有完整预反量化 B16 矩阵。packed FP16 解包不是 Q4 反量化；D 这里处理的是真实整数 QROW code。','D retains the C workgroup and four-column mapping. Loading a B tile reads the u32 code, shifts and masks it, subtracts the zero-point as integers, multiplies by scale, and converts to f16 before the same increasing-K fma. There is no complete pre-dequantized B16 matrix. Packed FP16 unpacking is not Q4 dequantization; D operates on integer QROW codes.'),
 ('kernel-only 中 A/B/C 已准备好 B16，而 D 包含解包和反量化。Q4 pilot 的 D GPU pass 慢于 C。完整路径 pilot 每次重新做 CPU 反量化、布局转换、必要上传，D 在这个口径明显更快。这不是矛盾：两个口径测的工作不同，且不能用于权重已准备并复用的情形。','In kernel-only measurements A/B/C already have B16, while D includes unpacking and dequantization. D was slower than C in the Q4 GPU-pass pilot. The full-path pilot repeats CPU dequantization, layout conversion, and required uploads each time, and D was substantially faster in that scope. These findings measure different work and do not apply to weights prepared once and reused.'),
 ('每个完整路径样本真正执行准备，独立记录墙钟；不将 CPU ms 与 GPU timestamp ms 相加称 GPU 时间，不由两个 median 相加推导总路径。一次准备成本和中间矩阵 bytes 单列。D 少分配的逻辑资源不等于物理 GPU 驻留节省，也不证明 Gemma 加速。','Every full-path sample actually repeats preparation and records wall time independently. CPU milliseconds are not added to GPU timestamp milliseconds and called GPU time; medians are not added to reconstruct a full-path median. One-time preparation and intermediate bytes are separate. Reduced logical allocations do not demonstrate physical GPU residency savings or Gemma acceleration.'),
 ('A–D pilot 每版本 10 warm-up、30 measured，四版本的 24 种排列先各一次，再补六种，位置次数为 7/8、每对先后为 15/15，固定种子打乱并导出。kernel-only 与完整路径分别采样。后续 repeat 使用冻结的多候选循环交错方案，而不是假设所有采集沿用这 24+6 排列。','The A–D pilot uses 10 warm-up and 30 measured passes per variant. Each of the 24 four-variant permutations appears once, followed by six balanced additions: positions have 7/8 occurrences and pairwise precedence is 15/15. A fixed seed shuffles and exports the order. Kernel-only and full-path are sampled separately. Later repeats use frozen multi-candidate cyclic interleaving, not this 24+6 scheme.')], ['measurement_contract','part2_repeat_results'])

page('part2_q8', ('Q8 路径与 Q4 的关系','Q8 path and its relationship to Q4'),
 ('Q8 复用 Q4 A–D 框架，但格式、stride 和输入范围有明确区别。','Q8 reuses the Q4 A–D framework with explicit format, stride, and input-range differences.'), [
 ('Q8 是 unsigned 0..255，每 u32 四个 code，行 stride=ceil(N/4)，掩码 255、shift=8*(n mod 4)。Q4 每 word 八个 code。二者都是低位先放、按行 packing、K group=32；负权重由 unsigned code 减 zeroPoint 得到，不进行二补码符号扩展。','Q8 uses unsigned 0..255 codes, four per u32, row stride ceil(N/4), mask 255, and shift=8*(n mod 4). Q4 holds eight codes per word. Both use least-significant-first row packing and K groups of 32. Negative weights arise by subtracting the zero-point, not by two’s-complement sign extension.'),
 ('Q8 非整数 scale=1/512，以约束较宽 code 范围下的幅度；activation 和 f16 fma 顺序、输出 carrier、reference 与冻结阈值保持契约。CPU 验证覆盖极值、零、word/row/group 尾部；Q4 回归仅做必要正确性，不重新采全部性能。','Q8 fractional scales are 1/512 to bound values despite the wider code range. Activations, f16 fma order, output carrier, references, and frozen criteria retain the contract. CPU checks cover extremes, zero, word/row/group tails. Q4 regression checks correctness without repeating its entire performance experiment.'),
 ('Q8 手机 A–D 已通过，随后完成 sweep 和五轮同轮复验。Q4/Q8 不同历史会话之间的差异只能描述，不能作受控格式因果结论；每个 speedup 的分母来自同一轮。两种格式都不是 Gemma 原生量化。','Q8 A–D passed phone validation, followed by the sweep and five repeat sessions. Differences between historical Q4/Q8 sessions are descriptive, not controlled causal evidence about formats. Every speedup denominator comes from the same session. Neither format is Gemma-native quantization.')], ['part2_compute_contract','part2_sweep_results','part2_repeat_results'])

page('part2_sweep_plan', ('有限 sweep 的冻结方案','Frozen bounded sweep plan'),
 ('sweep 只选择待复验候选，不是在中途无限调参。','The sweep selects candidates for repetition; it is not an open-ended tuning loop.'), [
 ('范围固定 Q4/Q8、M=1/128、K=N=1024。A 保持原配置；B/C/D 各最多三个候选，包含原配置。候选先过小矩阵、边界和 FP16 区分检查，再按 device limits 验证 invocation、共享存储和 buffer 要求。失败及 UNSUPPORTED 保留，不放宽阈值。','The scope is fixed at Q4/Q8, M=1/128, K=N=1024. A retains its original configuration; B/C/D have at most three candidates each, including the original. Candidates pass small-matrix, boundary, and FP16 discriminator checks, then device-limit checks for invocations, shared storage, and buffers. Failures and UNSUPPORTED records remain; tolerances are not relaxed.'),
 ('每候选 10 warm-up、30 measured，仅 prepared-input kernel-only。按固定 seed 0x53575001 派生顺序，循环位置平衡；实际顺序导出，不假设每一对候选先后完全一致。预算 1600 个采样 pass，加 420 个正确性 pass。','Each candidate has 10 warm-up and 30 measured passes, prepared-input kernel-only. Orders derive from fixed seed 0x53575001 with cyclic position balancing. Actual orders are exported; exact pairwise precedence balance is not assumed. The budget is 1600 sampling passes plus 420 correctness passes.'),
 ('预设选择正确性通过后的最低 median；与最低值相差不超过 65,536 ns 时暂不能区分，优先原配置。sweep 结果不能当稳定收益；选定结果在五轮复验前冻结，不依据复验再换候选。','Selection uses the lowest passing median. Candidates within 65,536 ns of the minimum are unresolved, preferring the original configuration. Sweep results do not establish stable gains. Selections were frozen before the five repeat sessions and not changed afterward.')], ['part2_sweep_results','part2_repeat_plan'])

page('part2_sweep_results', ('有限 sweep 结果与冻结选择','Bounded sweep results and frozen selections'),
 ('先看哪些配置被选中，再查看原始样本与失败记录。完整数据仍在共享结果中。','Start with the selected configurations, then inspect raw samples and failures. Complete data remain in shared results.'), [
 ('前两次 sweep 保留 COMPLETE_WITH_FAILURES，源码使用 WGSL 保留标识符 meta 导致编译失败；修正为 quantIndex 后第三次完成。没有删除失败运行，也没有修改其 JSON。第三次文件时间为 2026-10-06T06-07-34-319Z。','The first two sweeps remain COMPLETE_WITH_FAILURES: use of the WGSL reserved identifier meta caused compilation failures. Renaming it to quantIndex allowed the third run to complete. Failed runs were not deleted and their JSON was not modified. The successful file is dated 2026-10-06T06-07-34-319Z.'),
 ('冻结选择见下方表。配置名的两个数字是工作组 x/y，不一定是输出 tile：B 每 invocation 一列；C/D 每 invocation 四列。选择结果仅用于后续复验，当前性能判断以五次会话各自统计为准。','Frozen choices appear below. The two configuration numbers denote workgroup x/y, not necessarily the output tile: B computes one column per invocation, C/D four. The choices were for subsequent repetition; current performance interpretation uses the five individual sessions.')], ['part2_repeat_results','part2_sweep_plan'])

page('part2_repeat_plan', ('五次独立复验方法','Five independent repeat sessions'),
 ('复验用冻结配置检验波动与方向，不重新选择优化参数。','The repeat experiment tests variability and direction using frozen configurations; it does not reselect parameters.'), [
 ('每次重新加载页面，创建新的 session/device，重新准备和 warm-up。四组 Q4/Q8×M=1/128 比较固定 A、B/C/D 原配置及选定配置，相同配置去重，共 25 个候选组。每次会话 250 warm-up、750 measured，共 1000 个采样 pass。','Each session reloads the page, creates a fresh session/device, and repeats preparation and warm-up. Four Q4/Q8×M=1/128 groups compare fixed A, original B/C/D, and selected B/C/D, deduplicating identical configurations for 25 candidate groups. Each session has 250 warm-up and 750 measured passes, totaling 1000 sampling passes.'),
 ('每候选 30 个 measured，固定种子循环交错顺序导出。只测 kernel-only；准备、上传、reference、读回校验在 GPU 区间外。五次会话维持可记录的前台、供电和后台应用条件，未知仍写 UNKNOWN；保留警告、零值、长尾和失败。','Each candidate has 30 measured samples with exported fixed-seed cyclic interleaving. Only kernel-only is measured; preparation, upload, references, and output checks are outside GPU timing. The five sessions record foreground, power, and background-app conditions where available; unknowns remain UNKNOWN. Warnings, zeros, tails, and failures are retained.'),
 ('五次 Part 2 会话不能代替 Part 1 模型或进程内存重复。每会话 median/p95 和同轮比值分别报告；五轮范围是会话统计的范围，不是把 150 个样本合并后的指标。','Five Part 2 sessions do not replace Part 1 model or process-memory repetitions. Each session reports median/p95 and same-session ratios. Five-session ranges describe session statistics, not pooled metrics from 150 samples.')], ['part2_repeat_results','reproduction'])

page('part2_repeat_results', ('五轮结果：收益、负向和不确定性','Five-session results: gains, regressions, and uncertainty'),
 ('本文件提供逐轮绝对耗时和比值附录。先读方向性总结，再看每轮表，避免把最低单次结果当结论。','This document includes the per-session absolute-time and ratio appendix. Read the directional summary first; do not treat the single lowest observation as the conclusion.'), [
 ('五次会话均通过当前合成契约：离线核验 5000 个采样时间戳、232985 个导出小输出。性能大矩阵由页面在线全量校验；离线没有完整大型 actual 数组，不能声称独立复算了每个大输出。','All five sessions passed the synthetic contract. Offline verification checked 5000 sampling timestamps and 232985 exported small outputs. Large performance matrices were checked online in full. Complete large actual arrays were not exported, so offline verification cannot claim to reconstruct every large output.'),
 ('B 选定配置相对自身原配置在四组中五轮都改善，但尤其 M=1 不一定快于 A。M=128 的 D 选定配置两种量化都五轮改善。M=1 的 D 有方向反转及网格内差异；Q8 M=128 的 C 差异均在一个网格内，不能说稳定改善。','Selected B improved over its own original configuration in all five sessions for all four groups, but did not necessarily beat A, especially at M=1. Selected D improved at M=128 in both formats across all five sessions. M=1 D shows reversals and grid-scale differences. Q8 M=128 C differences are all within one grid and do not establish a stable improvement.'),
 ('保留 Q4 M=1 D 原/选定比值范围 0.895833..1.04545、Q8 M=1 D 0.933333..1.095238，以及 Q8 M=128 C 0.986301..1.0625。精确值见共享表。没有根据这些结果改变配置，不从变化推断缓存、带宽或调度瓶颈。','Retained original/selected ratio ranges include Q4 M=1 D 0.895833..1.04545, Q8 M=1 D 0.933333..1.095238, and Q8 M=128 C 0.986301..1.0625. Shared tables retain precise values. Configurations were not changed in response, and variation does not establish cache, bandwidth, or scheduling bottlenecks.')], ['part2_sweep_results','measurement_contract','reproduction'])

page('baseline_sessions_plan', ('模型会话采集方法','Model-session collection method'),
 ('BASELINE002 为原题 128/512/1024 输入长度各提供五次独立会话。长度是完整模板后的实际 tokenizer 计数。','BASELINE002 provides five independent sessions for each assignment input length, 128/512/1024. Length means the actual tokenizer count after including the full template.'), [
 ('使用 stock @mediapipe/tasks-genai@0.10.29 和已授权 Web 模型。sizeInTokens(fullPrompt) 检查完整输入；模板与正文的计数差为 8，但这不能证明内部 BOS 或 prefill tensor 长度。正文对应 120/504/1016。准备输入与 TOKEN_COUNT drain 不并入生成统计。','Use stock @mediapipe/tasks-genai@0.10.29 and the authorized Web model. sizeInTokens(fullPrompt) checks the complete input. The template/body count difference is 8, but does not prove internal BOS or prefill tensor length. Body counts are 120/504/1016. Prompt preparation and TOKEN_COUNT drain are separate from generation.'),
 ('maxTokens=2048 是输入加输出总容量，不是输出 token 数。topK=40、temperature=0.8、randomSeed=101、numResponses=1，文本输入，无图像/音频。每新任务一次生成，生成 warm-up=0；不清空系统/浏览器/驱动缓存，初始化与 token 准备分别记录。disableRewinding 保持未覆盖的 runtime 默认，不推断 native KV/prefix cache 的隔离；新 task 是操作策略，不是内部缓存状态证明。','maxTokens=2048 is total input-plus-output capacity, not output token count. Settings are topK=40, temperature=0.8, randomSeed=101, numResponses=1, text only, no images/audio. Each fresh task generates once, with zero generation warm-ups. System/browser/driver caches are not reset. Initialization and token preparation are recorded separately. disableRewinding retains the unoverridden runtime default. Fresh tasks are an operational policy, not proof of native KV/prefix-cache isolation.'),
 ('会话顺序固定为 128,512,1024,512,1024,128,1024,128,512,128,1024,512,512,128,1024。记录 runtime 准备、初始化、token 准备及 drain、生成调用至完成、首次 callback、生成后 drain。callback 可能含多个 token，首次 callback 不是纯 prefill。','The frozen session order is 128,512,1024,512,1024,128,1024,128,512,128,1024,512,512,128,1024. Record runtime preparation, initialization, token preparation and drain, generation call-to-completion, first callback, and post-generation drain. A callback can contain multiple tokens; the first callback is not pure prefill.')], ['baseline_sessions_results','model_preparation','reproduction'])

page('baseline_sessions_results', ('BASELINE002：十五次模型会话结果','BASELINE002: fifteen model-session results'),
 ('十五次独立会话均 COMPLETE，输出非空、完成正常、错误记录为空。这里报告可观测墙钟，不把可运行性验收等同于数值验证或原题全部完成。','All fifteen independent sessions are COMPLETE, with nonempty output, normal completion, and empty error records. These are observable wall-clock results, not numerical verification or completion of the entire assignment.'), [
 ('128/512/1024 完整输入长度均由实际 tokenizer 核对，各五次。初始化与生成分开；生成墙钟混合了公开 API 内部 prefill、decode 等工作，不能拆分纯 phase。首次 callback 延迟仅按其事件边界命名。','The tokenizer verified complete input lengths of 128/512/1024, with five sessions each. Initialization is separate from generation. Generation wall time combines work inside the public API, including prefill and decode, and cannot be split into pure phases. First-callback delay is named only by its event boundary.'),
 ('当前公开 API 不提供真实生成 token IDs/count；不按字符数、callback 数或重新 tokenize 文本算 tokens/s。各长度逐轮表在附录，内存按 JS heap、buffer、texture 和进程观察分别展示，不相加成为物理 GPU 内存。','The public API does not expose actual generated token IDs/counts. Characters, callback counts, or retokenized output are not used for tokens/s. Per-session tables appear in the appendix. JS heap, buffers, textures, and process observations are reported separately, never summed as physical GPU memory.')], ['memory001_texture_accounting','memory002_v2_pilot_results','remaining_metrics_feasibility'])

page('baseline002_work_summary', ('BASELINE002 交接摘要及历史范围','BASELINE002 handoff summary and historical scope'),
 ('这是模型会话工作的交接摘要。早期交接中的 texture 未覆盖项已被 MEMORY001 离线核算补齐，原始交接仍保存在历史快照。','This is a handoff summary for model sessions. Texture gaps in the earlier handoff were subsequently accounted for offline by MEMORY001; the original handoff remains in the historical snapshot.'), [
 ('当前已有十五次模型会话、完整输入计数、初始化/组合生成/首次 callback/drain 墙钟及逻辑资源记录。MEMORY001 支持已记录 texture payload，不补造未知资源；MEMORY002 v2 只是一轮进程范围 pilot。','Current evidence includes fifteen model sessions, complete input counts, initialization/combined generation/first-callback/drain wall times, and logical resource records. MEMORY001 covers recorded texture payloads without inventing unknown resources. MEMORY002 v2 is only a single process-scope pilot.'),
 ('后续缺口是实际输出 token、纯 phase、可信 kernel 时间表、完整进程内存重复、目标 Adreno 和真实有效逻辑层 shape。既有剩余指标与 TRACE001 审查已收敛，不继续重复相同时间戳诊断。','Remaining gaps are actual output tokens, pure phases, a trustworthy kernel-time table, complete process-memory repetitions, Adreno, and effective logical layer shapes. Existing feasibility and TRACE001 reviews bound these gaps; the same timestamp diagnosis is not repeated.')], ['baseline_sessions_results','assignment_requirements_matrix'])

page('environment', ('环境与证据来源','Environment and provenance'),
 ('区分用户截图、页面探测 adapter、runtime 实际 device 与原始 JSON。空值保留，不能由名称推断型号或 backend。','Separate user screenshots, the page’s adapter probe, the runtime’s actual device, and raw JSON. Preserve empty values; names do not establish a model or backend.'), [
 ('截图记录 OnePlus PMB110、Dimensity 9500、Mali-G1-Ultra MC12、Android 16、Chrome 154.0.8037.92。reduced userAgent 的 Android 10/K 不是实际系统版本证据。adapter vendor=arm、architecture=gen-5；device/description 空时不填猜测型号。','Screenshots record OnePlus PMB110, Dimensity 9500, Mali-G1-Ultra MC12, Android 16, and Chrome 154.0.8037.92. Android 10/K in the reduced user agent is not evidence of the actual OS. Adapter vendor is arm and architecture gen-5; empty device/description fields are not filled with guessed models.'),
 ('chrome://gpu/ANGLE 的 driver 2.1.28733 是该来源的元数据，不是已确认的 runtime WebGPU driver。环境探测 device 与 stock runtime device 分开；无法验证 runtime backend 时保持 UNKNOWN。adapter 支持 feature 不等于 device 已启用或实验已验证。','Driver 2.1.28733 from chrome://gpu/ANGLE is metadata from that source, not a confirmed runtime WebGPU driver. The probe device and stock runtime device are distinct; an unverified backend remains UNKNOWN. Adapter feature support does not mean a device enabled it or an experiment validated it.'),
 ('COMPUTE001 只验证 FP32，TIMING001 验证 timestamp-query；Part 2 的 FP16 路径还使用实际累加区分用例。adapter/device limits 分别记录，device 默认限制可能低于 adapter。thermal 是人工状态，不是温度传感器；charging、DevTools、flag、VPN/后台应用按每会话原始记录解释，不追补未知状态。','COMPUTE001 validates FP32 only; TIMING001 validates timestamp-query. Part 2 additionally checks the FP16 accumulation discriminator. Adapter/device limits are recorded separately, and device defaults may be lower. Thermal state is a manual observation, not a temperature sensor. Charging, DevTools, flags, VPN/background apps follow each session’s record; unknown history is not filled in afterward.')], ['model_preparation','baseline_sessions_results','measurement_contract'])

page('profiling_capabilities', ('固定 runtime 的可观测性','Observability of the fixed runtime'),
 ('审查固定 0.10.29 的 genai.d.ts、bundle、loader 和官方源码，区分公开接口与内部潜在线索。','This review examines genai.d.ts, the bundle, loader, and official source for fixed version 0.10.29, separating public APIs from internal leads.'), [
 ('sizeInTokens 提供输入计数，不提供真实生成 IDs/count。generateResponse 的文本 callback 不是 per-token 事件。输出重新分词不恢复生成时 token 序列。公开接口没有可信的独立 prefill/decode 计时边界。maxTokens 原 512 容量不足 1024 输入，BASELINE002 后来使用 2048 总容量。','sizeInTokens counts input, not actual generated IDs/counts. Text callbacks from generateResponse are not per-token events. Retokenizing output does not recover the generation-time token sequence. The public interface does not expose trustworthy separate prefill/decode timing boundaries. The earlier maxTokens=512 capacity could not cover 1024 input tokens; BASELINE002 uses total capacity 2048.'),
 ('PROFILE002 在初始化前安装可恢复的计数包装，保持 native this/参数/返回/异常。按 MODEL_INIT、TOKEN_COUNT、GENERATION、POST_GENERATION 分类；编码 dispatch 与已提交 command buffer 的 dispatch 分开。buffer 生命周期只记逻辑分配，destroy 不是物理释放证据。','PROFILE002 installs restorable count instrumentation before initialization, preserving native this, arguments, returns, and exceptions. Records are partitioned into MODEL_INIT, TOKEN_COUNT, GENERATION, and POST_GENERATION. Encoded dispatches are distinct from dispatches in submitted command buffers. Buffer lifecycle accounting tracks logical allocation; destroy does not prove physical release.'),
 ('PROFILE003 注入兼容 device 并增加 timestamp-query，不覆盖原 timestampWrites。读回成功不保证多个 pass 区间可加和；TIMING002 独立复现重叠后，模型 kernel 耗时归因被界定为不可用。具体源码身份和历史审查链接保存在原文快照及分析文件。','PROFILE003 injects a compatible device with timestamp-query without overwriting existing timestampWrites. Successful readback does not establish additive pass intervals. After TIMING002 independently reproduced overlap, model kernel-time attribution was classified as unavailable. Source identities and historical review references remain in the original snapshots and analysis files.')], ['profile002_shader_analysis','remaining_metrics_feasibility','timestamp_validity'])

page('profile002_shader_analysis', ('PROFILE002 shader 结构分析','PROFILE002 shader structure analysis'),
 ('分析按 GENERATION 实际提交的 command buffer 关联 pass、dispatch、pipeline 和 shader。次数用于结构覆盖，不是耗时证据。','Analysis links passes, dispatches, pipelines, and shaders through command buffers actually submitted during GENERATION. Counts describe structural coverage, not execution time.'), [
 ('180 个生成关联 shader 身份对应 132 个源码 hash；身份与相同源码不能混为一个概念。生成结构记录有 2005 个 pass、126402 次已提交 dispatch。重复提交按提交次数记录，未提交编码不算已执行。','There are 180 generation-associated shader identities and 132 source hashes. Identity and identical source are different concepts. The generation structure records 2005 passes and 126402 submitted dispatches. Repeated submissions are counted per submission; unsubmitted encoding is not counted as execution.'),
 ('分类依据源码乘加、索引、unpack、归一化等模式；可有多个融合标签，UNKNOWN 保留，不能将多个标签重复累计耗时。完整 180 项分类、entryPoint、hash、源码与置信度在共享分析表及 shader 文件中，不在两种语言下复制证据。','Classification uses source multiply-add, indexing, unpacking, normalization, and related patterns. Fused shaders can have multiple labels, and UNKNOWN remains unknown. Labels are not duplicated into separate time totals. The complete 180-entry classification, entry points, hashes, sources, and confidence live in shared analysis and shader files rather than copied evidence per language.'),
 ('最适合后续 shape 推导的是索引明确的矩阵实例。最终确认的是 M=8,K=1536,N=2048 数学执行维度，而不是有效模型层或 token/head 的语义。证据链见 shape 文档。','The most useful shape candidates have explicit matrix indexing. The established case has mathematical execution dimensions M=8,K=1536,N=2048, not confirmed effective model-layer or token/head semantics. The shape documents contain the evidence chain.')], ['gemm004_shape_proof','model_shape_recovery','timestamp_validity'])

page('gemm004_shape_proof', ('GEMM004 执行 shape 证明','GEMM004 execution-shape proof'),
 ('证明 shader 实际执行的矩阵数学与布局；这与模型有效张量维度、层用途是三个不同问题。','This proves the shader’s executed matrix mathematics and layout. Effective model tensor dimensions and layer purpose are separate questions.'), [
 ('已采集 U.i0=[512,8,384,0]、workgroup=8×4×1、dispatch=64×1×1。结论不是从 dispatch 大小猜出，而是由源码归约和地址表达式联合实际 uniform 推导。','Captured values are U.i0=[512,8,384,0], workgroup=8×4×1, and dispatch=64×1×1. The conclusion follows source reductions and address expressions together with actual uniforms, not a guess from dispatch size.'),
 ('布局映射为 A[r,4s+t]=texture(r,s)[t]，B[4s+t,4d+c]=weights[s*512+d][t][c]，C[r,4d+c]=texture(r,d)[c]。r=0..7、s=0..383、t/c=0..3、d=0..511，故执行矩阵为 M=8、K=1536、N=2048。packed FP16 mat4 的 stride 为 32 bytes；这不是 Q4/INT4 反量化。','The mapping is A[r,4s+t]=texture(r,s)[t], B[4s+t,4d+c]=weights[s*512+d][t][c], and C[r,4d+c]=texture(r,d)[c]. With r=0..7, s=0..383, t/c=0..3, d=0..511, the execution matrix is M=8, K=1536, N=2048. The packed FP16 mat4 stride is 32 bytes; this is not Q4/INT4 dequantization.'),
 ('这些表达式证明数学执行轴与重排关系，但不能证明 8 lanes 是有效 token、batch 或 head，也不能证明 padding 后维度等于有效逻辑维度，层用途仍 UNKNOWN。GEMM004 使用合成 FP32 输入测试该执行 shape；不是原 FP16 算子的数值等价复现，不用于模型加速结论。','These expressions prove execution axes and a layout conversion, but do not prove that the eight lanes are effective tokens, batches, or heads, nor that padded dimensions equal effective logical dimensions. Layer purpose remains UNKNOWN. GEMM004 tests this execution shape with synthetic FP32 inputs; it is not a numerically equivalent reproduction of the FP16 operator and does not establish model acceleration.')], ['model_shape_recovery','assignment_requirements_matrix'])

page('model_shape_recovery', ('真实实例恢复：已知与未知','Model-instance recovery: known and unknown'),
 ('从 shader 数学、运行参数和模型语义三个层次恢复 shape，避免把 buffer 大小或模型常识当证明。','Recover shapes at three levels: shader mathematics, runtime parameters, and model semantics. Buffer size or model familiarity is not proof.'), [
 ('SHAPE001 第一次 INCOMPLETE 保留；后续参数采集补齐选定实例 uniform 和使用版本。离线证明得到执行 M=8,K=1536,N=2048 与 row-major 重排关系。关键证据是实际提交关联及索引，不是 buffer payload 可容纳的元素数。','The initial INCOMPLETE SHAPE001 remains preserved. Later parameter collection captured the selected uniform and its version at use. Offline proof established execution M=8,K=1536,N=2048 and a row-major conversion. The essential evidence is submitted-command association and indexing, not how many elements fit in a buffer.'),
 ('有效逻辑维度、padding 的有效边界、lane 的 token/batch/head 身份、层名未得到完整元数据证实，保留 UNKNOWN。GEMM004 因数学 shape 证据充分已解锁并实测，不要求知道层名才能做补充实验；但不能关闭原题真实有效 layer shape 缺口。','Effective logical dimensions, valid padding boundaries, token/batch/head lane identity, and layer name lack complete metadata proof and remain UNKNOWN. GEMM004 was enabled and tested because mathematical-shape evidence sufficed for a supplement, without needing a layer name. It does not close the assignment’s effective layer-shape requirement.')], ['gemm004_shape_proof','profile002_shader_analysis'])

page('profile003_overlap_review', ('PROFILE003 离线重叠审查','PROFILE003 offline overlap review'),
 ('离线核对相邻时间戳、提交关联和查询生命周期，不改变原始区间来制造可加和结果。','This offline review checks neighboring timestamps, submission links, and query lifecycles without altering intervals to make them additive.'), [
 ('检查 query index 唯一性、resolve/copy 晚于写入、重复 submit、stale read 和 BigInt 单位转换，未找到可证明解释全部重叠的实现 bug。相邻区间按同 command buffer、同 submit、跨 submit 分类，完整诊断与异常 ID 保存在共享数据。','The review examines unique query indices, resolve/copy ordering after writes, repeated submissions, stale reads, and BigInt unit conversion. No proven implementation bug explaining all overlap was found. Neighboring intervals are grouped by command buffer, submit, and cross-submit relationship; shared diagnostics retain anomaly IDs.'),
 ('重叠不能仅因小于一个网格就归因为量化；较大重叠也实际存在。后续 TIMING002 在独立 vector-add 对照复现。当前 PROFILE003 不用于独占 kernel 排名、加和 breakdown 或瓶颈定位。','Overlap is not attributed to quantization merely because it is within one grid; larger overlaps also exist. TIMING002 later reproduced the issue with independent vector-add controls. PROFILE003 is not used for exclusive kernel rankings, additive breakdowns, or bottleneck attribution.')], ['timestamp_validity','trace001_availability'])

page('timestamp_validity', ('时间戳有效性与收敛结论','Timestamp validity and bounded conclusion'),
 ('成功读回时间戳与可以归因耗时是不同验收项。串行单 pass 对照与连续模型 pass 也不是同一执行条件。','Reading timestamps successfully and attributing execution time are distinct acceptance criteria. Serial single-pass controls and consecutive model passes also have different execution conditions.'), [
 ('TIMING002 同 command buffer 连续 pass 有 7/7 重叠，overlap min/median/p95/max 为 13.631488/31.784960/50.069504/50.069504 ms；连续 submit 为 7/7，9.895936/25.690112/40.173568/40.173568 ms；串行等待为 0/7。所有正重叠超过 65,536 ns。','TIMING002 consecutive passes in one command buffer show 7/7 overlaps, with overlap min/median/p95/max of 13.631488/31.784960/50.069504/50.069504 ms. Consecutive submissions show 7/7, at 9.895936/25.690112/40.173568/40.173568 ms. Serial waits show 0/7. Every positive overlap exceeds 65,536 ns.'),
 ('独立实验复现说明不能只归咎于模型 instrumentation；没有证据确定具体平台原因，保持 UNKNOWN。串行等待改变了执行条件，支持受控 GEMM 单 pass 方法的观察，不能代替 stock 模型性能。','Independent reproduction means the issue cannot simply be blamed on model instrumentation. The specific platform cause remains UNKNOWN. Serial waits change execution conditions and support observations under the controlled single-pass GEMM method, not stock model performance.'),
 ('保留原始时间戳、关联和零值，不重排、裁剪或平均分摊。当前只交付结构表和有效性诊断；模型 pass 不支持可加和 GPU stacked breakdown。','Raw timestamps, links, and zeros remain intact, without reordering, clipping, or equal allocation. Current deliverables are structural tables and validity diagnostics; model passes do not support an additive GPU stacked breakdown.')], ['measurement_contract','remaining_metrics_feasibility'])

page('memory001_texture_accounting', ('MEMORY001：texture 逻辑 payload','MEMORY001: logical texture payload'),
 ('仅从 BASELINE002 已归档资源描述与生命周期核算，不重跑模型。payload 是逻辑 texel 数据量，不是物理分配或上传 row padding。','Accounting uses archived BASELINE002 resource descriptors and lifecycle events only, without rerunning the model. Payload means logical texel data, not physical allocation or upload row padding.'), [
 ('每 texel：rgba8uint=4 bytes；rgba16uint/rgba16float=8；rgba32uint/rgba32sint/rgba32float=16。依据 WebGPU 格式定义，逐 mip 累加宽×高×层/深度×sampleCount×每 texel bytes。2D array 的层数不随 mip 缩小；3D depth 随 mip 缩小。缺 dimension、extent、层数、mip 或 sample 字段时 UNAVAILABLE，不用默认猜测。','Bytes per texel are rgba8uint=4, rgba16uint/rgba16float=8, and rgba32uint/rgba32sint/rgba32float=16. WebGPU format definitions support summing width×height×layers/depth×sampleCount×bytes per texel across mips. 2D array layers stay constant; 3D depth shrinks with mips. Missing dimension, extent, layers, mip, or sample fields produce UNAVAILABLE, not guessed defaults.'),
 ('十五次会话各 500 个 texture，共 7500 个，已记录资源覆盖 100%。累计创建 payload 为 1,707,579,096 bytes；可重建活跃峰值为 1,707,566,808 bytes，发生在 MODEL_INIT。累计创建不等于峰值。初始化前 observer 未安装，texture/buffer 不可得而不是 0。','Each of fifteen sessions records 500 textures, totaling 7500, with 100% coverage of recorded resources. Cumulative created payload is 1,707,579,096 bytes; reconstructable live peak is 1,707,566,808 bytes in MODEL_INIT. Cumulative creation is not a peak. Before observer installation, texture/buffer accounting is unavailable, not zero.'),
 ('JS heap API 在记录中反复给出 used=10,000,000 bytes，这不是没有内存增长的证明。buffer、texture 逻辑快照分别报告；显式 destroy 后账面下降不证明物理释放或泄漏。未观测 native/WASM 整体、物理 GPU 驻留和其它未捕获资源。','JS heap API repeatedly reports used=10,000,000 bytes; this is not proof of no growth. Buffer and texture logical snapshots are separate. Ledger decreases after explicit destroy do not prove physical release or leaks. Overall native/WASM memory, physical GPU residency, and uncaptured resources remain unobserved.')], ['baseline_sessions_results','memory002_v2_pilot_results'])

page('adb_memory_sampling_plan', ('进程内存采集方法与角色证据','Process-memory sampling and role evidence'),
 ('RSS/PSS 是进程范围观察；先证明角色，再讨论页面归属。方法准备不等于正式重复验收。','RSS/PSS observations are process-scoped. Establish process roles before page ownership. Method readiness does not satisfy formal repetition requirements.'), [
 ('browser/GPU 角色由本轮进程命令行与 start ticks 证据核验；renderer 角色与目标页面映射分开。仅 target ID、唯一 renderer 或旧 PID 不足以证明归属。元数据失败保持 UNKNOWN，不复用历史身份。','Browser/GPU roles are checked using current command lines and start ticks. Renderer role and target-page mapping are separate. A target ID, a single renderer, or an old PID does not prove ownership. Metadata failures remain UNKNOWN rather than reusing past identities.'),
 ('原始系统清单和 DevTools 输出在本地忽略目录保存；公开仅派生数字、方法和哈希。临时调试隧道仅绑定 127.0.0.1，限定元数据，不读其它页面或会话内容，成功失败都撤销并核对。','Raw system lists and DevTools output remain in a local ignored directory. Only derived numbers, methods, and hashes are public. Temporary debugging tunnels bind only 127.0.0.1 and inspect limited metadata, not other pages or session contents; cleanup is checked after success or failure.'),
 ('RSS 跨进程相加会重复计入共享页；PSS 也不是模型独占或物理 GPU 内存。命令有耗时，生成期间样本是窗口，不是瞬时点或连续峰值。窗口跨阶段或无法关联时标 MIXED/UNKNOWN。','Summing RSS across processes can double-count shared pages. PSS is neither model-exclusive nor physical GPU memory. Commands take time, so generation samples are windows rather than instantaneous points or continuous peaks. Windows crossing phases or lacking association are MIXED/UNKNOWN.')], ['memory002_capture_protocol','memory002_pilot_results','memory002_v2_pilot_results'])

page('memory002_capture_protocol', ('MEMORY002 v2 冻结采集协议','MEMORY002 v2 frozen capture protocol'),
 ('协议解决空闲基线缺失、阶段握手和跨设备时间关联问题。这里记录已实施的门禁，不安排新的手机实验。','This protocol addresses missing idle baselines, phase handshakes, and cross-device clock association. It documents implemented gates, without scheduling a new phone experiment.'), [
 ('初始化前必须取得合格 IDLE 回执，否则状态 BLOCKED_UNTIL_IDLE_CAPTURE，不能进入正式采集。等待点为 AFTER_INIT、BEFORE_GENERATION、AFTER_DRAIN；记录页面阶段标记、电脑接收、命令开始/结束和回执后继续。','A qualified IDLE receipt is required before initialization; otherwise status is BLOCKED_UNTIL_IDLE_CAPTURE and formal capture cannot begin. Waiting points are AFTER_INIT, BEFORE_GENERATION, and AFTER_DRAIN. Record the page marker, host receipt, command start/end, and continuation after receipt.'),
 ('时间偏移区间由双向请求包络约束，计入 2 ms guard；epoch 与 monotonic 差异超过 5 ms 的校准无效。生成样本须前后校准包围，并确认整个采样窗口落在生成区间；否则 MIXED/UNKNOWN。v2 观察的不确定范围宽 28.975 ms 是条件性界限，不是绝对同步精度。','Clock-offset intervals are bounded by bidirectional request envelopes with a 2 ms guard. Calibration is invalid if epoch/monotonic disagreement exceeds 5 ms. Generation sampling needs bracketing calibrations and the entire window inside generation; otherwise it is MIXED/UNKNOWN. The observed v2 uncertainty width of 28.975 ms is a conditional bound, not guaranteed synchronization accuracy.'),
 ('每次重新查询 PID、角色、start ticks；页面归属保持单独 UNKNOWN。服务用 serve_memory002.py 的回环控制接口，不由普通 http.server 替代。每次转发清理都保存检查；失败原文留本地，公开派生限制不删除失败。','Each capture rechecks PID, role, and start ticks; page ownership can separately remain UNKNOWN. Use the loopback control endpoint in serve_memory002.py, not an ordinary http.server replacement. Every forwarding cleanup is checked. Failure originals stay local, while public derivatives retain their limitations.')], ['memory002_v2_pilot_results','reproduction'])

page('memory002_pilot_results', ('MEMORY002 v1：PARTIAL 记录','MEMORY002 v1: PARTIAL record'),
 ('这是失败及可用数据的历史报告，不被 v2 的协议通过覆盖。','This historical report retains failures and usable data; the v2 protocol pass does not overwrite it.'), [
 ('v1 缺初始化前合格空闲快照，进程角色查询出现 WinError 2，生成采样窗口与页面时钟关联不足。保留快照、失败和原始日志，状态 PARTIAL；不能计算可信空闲差值或声称完整阶段覆盖。','v1 lacks a qualified pre-initialization idle snapshot, process-role queries encountered WinError 2, and generation-window/page-clock association was insufficient. Snapshots, failures, and raw logs are retained with PARTIAL status. Trustworthy idle deltas and complete phase coverage cannot be claimed.'),
 ('已有系统数字只能按成功查询的范围阅读；未知角色不沿用旧 PID。v2 修正了门禁和握手，但不将本次记录补造为通过，也不删除初始化期间后台切换警告。','Existing system numbers are usable only within successfully queried scope; unknown roles are not filled using old PIDs. v2 tightened gates and handshakes without retroactively turning this run into a pass or removing background-switch warnings.')], ['memory002_capture_protocol','memory002_v2_pilot_results'])

page('memory002_v2_pilot_results', ('MEMORY002 v2：有条件协议通过','MEMORY002 v2: conditional protocol pass'),
 ('状态为 PROTOCOL_PASS_WITH_CONDITION_WARNING，仅验收一次采集协议，不是正式内存要求全部通过。','Status is PROTOCOL_PASS_WITH_CONDITION_WARNING. This accepts one capture protocol pilot, not the full memory requirement.'), [
 ('一次 128-token pilot 取得 IDLE、AFTER_INIT、GENERATION、AFTER_DRAIN，另有 BEFORE_GENERATION；共五次快照、十个 browser/GPU 读数。初始化后台切换 5606.1 ms 保留。browser PID 14567、GPU PID 11306 本轮有角色证据；renderer 11292 的页面归属仍 UNKNOWN。','One 128-token pilot covers IDLE, AFTER_INIT, GENERATION, and AFTER_DRAIN, plus BEFORE_GENERATION: five snapshots and ten browser/GPU readings. The 5606.1 ms background interval during initialization remains recorded. Browser PID 14567 and GPU PID 11306 have current role evidence; page ownership for renderer 11292 remains UNKNOWN.'),
 ('GPU 进程 PSS/RSS（KiB）从空闲 162986/304373 到初始化后 2163859/2446557、生成窗口 2693656/2976429、drain 后 2167082/2449841。这是观测窗口内进程数字，不是模型独占、物理 GPU 内存或连续峰值。browser 单列见附录。','GPU-process PSS/RSS (KiB) goes from idle 162986/304373 to 2163859/2446557 after initialization, 2693656/2976429 in the generation window, and 2167082/2449841 after drain. These are process observations within sample windows, not model-exclusive memory, physical GPU memory, or continuous peaks. Browser figures are separate in the appendix.'),
 ('私有系统原文与 v2 页面 JSON 仍留忽略目录；公开派生记录及哈希允许本机核验，干净 clone 不具备私有原文。十次临时转发检查已清理。五次进程内存重复未完成，不追加实验。','Private system originals and the v2 page JSON remain ignored locally. Public derivatives and hashes support local verification, but a clean clone lacks the private originals. Ten temporary-forwarding cleanup checks passed. Five process-memory repetitions remain incomplete, with no additional experiment scheduled.')], ['memory002_capture_protocol','assignment_requirements_matrix'])

page('remaining_metrics_feasibility', ('剩余指标可行性审查','Remaining-metric feasibility review'),
 ('限时审查现有接口与证据，不运行模型、不增加 profiler。UNKNOWN 不用估计值填补。','This bounded review uses existing interfaces and evidence without running the model or expanding the profiler. UNKNOWN values are not replaced by estimates.'), [
 ('真实输出 token：公开接口无 IDs/count；内部 DECODED_IDS 是未验证线索，不是可用测量入口。重新 tokenize 文本不等于真实生成序列。prefill/decode：公开生成调用没有可靠独立边界，首次 callback 不作纯 prefill，callback 数不作 token 数。','Actual output tokens: public APIs expose no IDs/count. Internal DECODED_IDS is an unvalidated lead, not an available measurement entry. Retokenizing text does not recover the actual generated sequence. Prefill/decode: the public generation call has no reliable separate boundaries. First callback is not pure prefill, and callback count is not token count.'),
 ('Chrome/Dawn CPU 提交事件可能说明主机结构，但不能当 GPU 执行时间或与 shader 自动归因。TRACE001 本机没有已证实执行时间线源；当前不能补可信 stacked breakdown。最小验证必须先证明真实 token/phase hook 或时间线到目标 dispatch 的关联，而不是继续收集更多同口径墙钟。','Chrome/Dawn CPU submission events may reveal host structure, but are not GPU execution time or automatic shader attribution. TRACE001 found no proven execution timeline source on this phone, so a trustworthy stacked breakdown remains unavailable. A minimal next validation must establish a real token/phase hook or timeline-to-target-dispatch mapping, not gather more wall times of the same scope.')], ['trace001_availability','assignment_requirements_matrix'])

page('trace001_availability', ('TRACE001 数据源可用性结论','TRACE001 data-source availability'),
 ('区分官方列出的功能和当前手机实际注册、可访问的源。没有采集模型 trace。','Separate documented capabilities from sources actually registered and accessible on this phone. No model trace was captured.'), [
 ('本机 Perfetto v49 实际查询到 android.gpu.memory；未查询到 gpu.renderstages、gpu.counters 或相关 vendor 执行源。普通 shell 的 tracefs 访问受限，debug 路径不可用。配置转换失败也保留，不修改权限、不 root。','Actual Perfetto v49 queries found android.gpu.memory, but not gpu.renderstages, gpu.counters, or relevant vendor execution sources. Ordinary shell access to tracefs is restricted and the debug path is unavailable. Configuration-conversion failures remain recorded; no permission changes or root were used.'),
 ('GPU 内存数据源存在不证明有执行时间线，更不证明能关联 WebGPU dispatch/shader。当前执行时间线不可用，算子关联 UNKNOWN；这仅界定本机当前权限路径，不证明所有平台都不可能。保留 kernel breakdown 缺口并转入报告整理。','A GPU-memory source does not establish an execution timeline, much less WebGPU dispatch/shader mapping. The current execution timeline is unavailable and operator attribution UNKNOWN. This bounds the phone’s current permission path, not all platforms. The kernel-breakdown gap remains and work proceeds to reporting.')], ['remaining_metrics_feasibility','timestamp_validity'])

page('archive_validation', ('历史归档核验的范围','Scope of historical archive verification'),
 ('早期归档核验是当时证据集合的结果，不是全部后续实验的总验收。','Earlier archive validation covers the evidence set available then, not acceptance of all later experiments.'), [
 ('原始记录、失败状态、验证 JSON 与哈希保持字节不变。当前双语整理另建文档检查结果，不覆盖既有核验记录。早期 Q8 未完成等陈述是历史状态，当前 Q4/Q8 五轮结论见报告及结果文档。','Raw records, failure states, verification JSON, and hashes remain byte-preserved. This bilingual reorganization creates separate documentation-check results rather than overwriting existing verification records. Earlier statements such as Q8 pending are historical; current Q4/Q8 repeat conclusions are in the report and results.'),
 ('离线验证小用例全部导出输出、时间戳差和顺序；大型配置只导出了在线摘要及部分 reference，不能补造未导出的 actual。私有系统证据只发布派生数据与哈希。','Offline checks validate all exported small outputs, timestamp differences, and orders. Large cases export online summaries and some reference records, not complete actual arrays; missing actuals cannot be reconstructed. Private system evidence is represented publicly by derivatives and hashes.')], ['evidence_index','documentation_inventory'])

page('experiment_template', ('实验记录模板','Experiment-record template'),
 ('用于未来记录的一致模板，不是新实验授权，也不生成假结果。','A consistent template for future records; it neither authorizes a new experiment nor creates invented results.'), [
 ('记录 Question、Setup、计算契约与来源、输入/输出、预设阈值、计时边界、warm-up/measured、顺序与种子、环境、验收标准。运行前 Result=NOT_RUN；实际运行后链接原始 JSON、哈希和核验，再写观察。','Record Question, Setup, contract/source, inputs/outputs, preset tolerances, timing boundaries, warm-up/measured counts, order/seeds, environment, and acceptance criteria. Before execution Result=NOT_RUN. After execution link raw JSON, hashes, and verification before reporting observations.'),
 ('分别写当时状态、当前结论、失败记录、源码事实、实测观察和待验证解释。未知写 UNKNOWN/UNAVAILABLE/NOT_MEASURED，不用计划代替证据；历史失败不删除。','Separate contemporaneous status, current conclusion, failures, source facts, observations, and hypotheses. Use UNKNOWN/UNAVAILABLE/NOT_MEASURED where appropriate. Plans do not substitute for evidence and historical failures remain.')], ['experiment_log','measurement_contract'])

page('model_preparation', ('本地模型与 runtime 准备','Local model and runtime preparation'),
 ('模型和 runtime 资源本地提供，但不提交大权重、下载缓存或 node_modules。需要先取得官方模型授权。','Model and runtime resources are served locally, but large weights, download caches, and node_modules are not committed. Obtain official model access first.'), [
 ('指定文件 gemma-3n-E2B-it-int4-Web.litertlm 位于 assets/models/。实际大小 3,038,117,888 bytes，SHA256 为 b6c8e1081ec80730f14473a5ece941b48da5d8e2a80c97c2963da153f3eff3d2。文件名必须含 -Web，不能使用 Android 文件替代；这是本地身份校验，不是已与发布方 checksum 对比的声明。','The specified gemma-3n-E2B-it-int4-Web.litertlm resides in assets/models/. Its actual size is 3,038,117,888 bytes and SHA256 is b6c8e1081ec80730f14473a5ece941b48da5d8e2a80c97c2963da153f3eff3d2. The filename must contain -Web; do not substitute the Android artifact. This is local identity verification, not a claim of comparison with a publisher checksum.'),
 ('在 Hugging Face 官方页面登录并接受许可后手动下载至该目录。不绕过授权，不将 token 写入代码或日志。genai JS/WASM 都固定 0.10.29，本地 vendor 资源按 manifest 准备，不用 latest；记录源码来源，但未保存模型 main 的不可变 revision。','Log into the official Hugging Face page, accept its license, and manually download to that directory. Do not bypass access restrictions or write tokens into code or logs. GenAI JS and WASM are both pinned to 0.10.29 and prepared locally according to the manifest, never latest. Source provenance is recorded, but an immutable model main revision was not saved.'),
 ('PowerShell 校验：Get-Item assets/models/gemma-3n-E2B-it-int4-Web.litertlm | Select-Object Length；Get-FileHash assets/models/gemma-3n-E2B-it-int4-Web.litertlm -Algorithm SHA256。模型文件大小不是运行内存。','PowerShell checks: Get-Item assets/models/gemma-3n-E2B-it-int4-Web.litertlm | Select-Object Length; Get-FileHash assets/models/gemma-3n-E2B-it-int4-Web.litertlm -Algorithm SHA256. Model file size is not runtime memory.')], ['reproduction','environment'])

page('reproduction', ('复现与离线核验','Reproduction and offline verification'),
 ('本轮只整理文档。以下运行步骤供以后使用，不表示本轮执行了手机或模型。','This round only reorganizes documentation. The following steps support later reproduction; they do not mean a phone or model was run in this round.'), [
 ('在项目根目录运行 python -m http.server 8000 --bind 127.0.0.1。USB 调试授权后执行 & "C:\\Tools\\platform-tools\\platform-tools\\adb.exe" reverse tcp:8000 tcp:8000。手机 Chrome 使用 http://localhost:8000/；不要使用电脑局域网 IP。','From the repository root run python -m http.server 8000 --bind 127.0.0.1. After authorizing USB debugging, run & "C:\\Tools\\platform-tools\\platform-tools\\adb.exe" reverse tcp:8000 tcp:8000. Phone Chrome accesses http://localhost:8000/; do not use the PC LAN address.'),
 ('模型入口 /src/baseline/sessions.html?v=baseline-session-v1；Part 2 五轮入口 /src/benchmark/part2_repeat.html?v=repeat-v1。每轮重新加载并选择正确编号、记录环境、运行后下载独立 JSON。MEMORY002 另用 serve_memory002.py 及握手协议，不能用普通 HTTP server 代替控制接口。','Model entry: /src/baseline/sessions.html?v=baseline-session-v1. Part 2 repeat entry: /src/benchmark/part2_repeat.html?v=repeat-v1. Reload for each session, select the correct ordinal, record conditions, then download independent JSON. MEMORY002 uses serve_memory002.py and its handshake protocol; a plain HTTP server does not replace the control endpoint.'),
 ('仅重建文档：python scripts/render_bilingual_docs.py；检查：python scripts/check_bilingual_docs.py 与 python scripts/check_stage_delivery.py。已有核验脚本 verify_baseline_sessions.py、verify_part2_repeat_result.py、verify_memory001.py 支持离线核验，但其默认 CLI 会写派生记录；本轮为保持已有核验字节不变只调用只读 audit/verify 接口。图表仍共享 report/figures，由 plot_stage_report.py 读取共享阶段数据。','Documentation-only rebuild: python scripts/render_bilingual_docs.py. Checks: python scripts/check_bilingual_docs.py and python scripts/check_stage_delivery.py. Existing verify_baseline_sessions.py, verify_part2_repeat_result.py, and verify_memory001.py support offline checks, but their default CLIs write derived records. To preserve existing verification bytes this round uses read-only audit/verify interfaces. Figures remain shared in report/figures, read from stage data by plot_stage_report.py.'),
 ('干净 clone 没有模型、local vendor 和私有 adb/DevTools 原文，须按来源准备；仅公开派生数据可直接阅读。不能将私有证据缺失误称核验失败，也不能声称干净 clone 可复现私有采样。','A clean clone lacks model weights, local vendor resources, and private adb/DevTools originals; prepare authorized resources from their sources. Public derivatives remain readable directly. Missing private evidence is not the same as a failed verification, and private captures cannot be reproduced from a clean clone alone.')], ['model_preparation','evidence_index','memory002_capture_protocol'])

page('evidence_index', ('证据与公开范围索引','Evidence and publication-scope index'),
 ('原始证据只保留一份；两种语言引用同一 JSON、核验和图表，不复制或改写数据。','Evidence is kept once. Both languages reference the same JSON, verification records, and figures without copying or rewriting data.'), [
 ('results/raw 保存已公开手机实验，results/analysis 保存派生及核验。raw_sha256_manifest.json 为历史原始哈希清单；stage_delivery_data.json 提供当前报告共享表。PROFILE002 shader 源码位于 results/analysis/profile002/shaders。','results/raw stores published phone experiments, while results/analysis stores derivatives and verification. raw_sha256_manifest.json records historical raw hashes; stage_delivery_data.json supplies shared report tables. PROFILE002 shader sources are in results/analysis/profile002/shaders.'),
    ('原始 assignment 保存在 assignment/webgpu_adreno_assignment.pdf，摘要不是权威原件译文。邮件 updates、模型权重、vendor、私有系统输出和临时 integrity 快照不纳入文档发布。历史 Markdown 原样快照用于保留当时状态；其旧链接是历史文本，不作为当前导航。','The original assignment is assignment/webgpu_adreno_assignment.pdf; summaries are not authoritative translations. Emails in updates, model weights, vendor resources, private system output, and temporary integrity snapshots are excluded from documentation publication. Byte-preserved historical Markdown snapshots retain contemporaneous states; their old links are historical text, not current navigation.')], ['documentation_inventory','archive_validation'])

page('requirements', ('任务范围与要求导航','Task scope and requirements navigation'),
 ('原题分为 stock 模型观察和自写量化 GEMM 两部分，不能用补充实验替代要求。逐项状态由要求矩阵维护。','The assignment separates stock-model observation from custom quantized GEMM. Supplemental experiments do not replace requirements. The requirement matrix maintains individual statuses.'), [
 ('Part 1 要求 Gemma E2B、目标 Adreno、128/512/1024 输入及各指标至少五次、真实吞吐/phase、内存、dispatch/token、kernel 时间与 breakdown。当前完整输入与组合墙钟已取得，其余按证据标 PARTIAL/BLOCKED/NOT_RUN。','Part 1 calls for Gemma E2B, target Adreno, 128/512/1024 inputs with at least five runs per metric, actual throughput/phases, memory, dispatch/token, kernel times, and breakdown. Complete inputs and combined wall times are available; other requirements remain PARTIAL/BLOCKED/NOT_RUN as supported.'),
 ('Part 2 要求 Q4/Q8 反量化 GEMM 的 FP16 accumulation 和 A–D、tile/workgroup 探索、正确性、GFLOPS/有效 GB/s 与比较。实现及 Mali 合成契约验收不等于目标硬件和真实有效层 shape 验收。五轮 Part 2 是追加的复验要求，不伪称原题 Part 2 明确重复句。','Part 2 calls for Q4/Q8 dequantization GEMM with FP16 accumulation, A–D, tile/workgroup exploration, correctness, GFLOPS/effective GB/s, and comparison. Implementation and Mali synthetic-contract acceptance do not satisfy target hardware or effective real-layer shapes. Five Part 2 repeats are an added repeat requirement, not falsely attributed to an explicit Part 2 sentence.'),
 ('原题的 if available 工具和示例分类证据与 mandatory 区分。旧计划 CSV/未建页面链接不再作为当前交付入口，改链实际 JSON、源码和已验收页面；原始计划保留在历史快照。','Tools qualified by if available and example classification evidence are distinct from mandatory requirements. Old planned CSV/nonexistent-page links are not current delivery entry points; navigation uses actual JSON, source, and accepted pages. Original plans remain in historical snapshots.')], ['assignment_requirements_matrix','evidence_index'])

page('assignment_requirements_matrix', ('原题逐项要求矩阵','Assignment requirement matrix'),
 ('下方按原始 PDF 页码保留要求摘要与已有状态，不把某实验 COMPLETE 扩大为整体 COMPLETE。英文原文片段不是项目译文的权威来源。','The table preserves requirement excerpts, PDF page references, and established statuses. An experiment marked COMPLETE does not make the assignment COMPLETE. The original PDF, not a project translation, is authoritative.'), [
 ('COMPLETE 表示该行限定范围已具备证据；PARTIAL 表示只满足部分；BLOCKED 表示当前入口或有效证据受限；NOT_RUN 表示未执行。整体和两个 Part 都是 PARTIAL。具体缺口与最小下一步在表中分列。','COMPLETE means evidence exists within that row’s limited scope; PARTIAL means only part is covered; BLOCKED means current interfaces or valid evidence prevent coverage; NOT_RUN means not executed. Overall and both Parts remain PARTIAL. Gaps and minimal next steps are separate table columns.')], ['requirements','remaining_metrics_feasibility','evidence_index'])

page('experiment_log', ('历史实验时间线与当前结论','Historical experiment timeline and current conclusions'),
 ('历史日志按原记录顺序保留，不覆盖 NOT_RUN、INCOMPLETE 或失败。这里是双语阅读版时间线，原始详细叙述和所有表格保存在字节不变的历史快照。','The log preserves original order and does not overwrite NOT_RUN, INCOMPLETE, or failures. This is a bilingual reading timeline; original detailed narratives and all tables remain in byte-preserved historical snapshots.'), [
 ('先区分当时状态与当前结论：COMPUTE/TIMING 的 capability 验证、FP32 GEMM 补充、QROW Part 2、stock 模型及内存观察各自有验收范围。早期“尚未运行”不会作为当前入口的状态。','Separate contemporaneous status from current conclusions: COMPUTE/TIMING capability validation, supplemental FP32 GEMM, QROW Part 2, stock-model sessions, and memory observations each have distinct acceptance scopes. Earlier “not yet run” text is not the status of current entry points.'),
 ('失败记录包括 PROFILE002 的采集不完整、SHAPE001 初次不完整、两次 sweep 编译失败、MEMORY002 v1 PARTIAL；修复或后续验收不删除这些记录。当前整体仍 PARTIAL，未实测指标不由后来的其它实验补齐。','Failures include incomplete PROFILE002 capture, initial incomplete SHAPE001, two sweep compilation failures, and MEMORY002 v1 PARTIAL. Fixes or later acceptance do not delete them. Overall status remains PARTIAL; later unrelated experiments do not fill unmeasured metrics.')], ['archive_validation','evidence_index','assignment_requirements_matrix'])

page('documentation_inventory', ('文档覆盖清单与维护方式','Documentation inventory and maintenance'),
 ('本轮基于已跟踪 Markdown 建立中英文对应，旧路径只保留导航。清单含类别、原路径、语言版本和原文快照哈希。','This reorganization maps tracked Markdown to Chinese/English counterparts. Old paths retain navigation only. The inventory includes categories, original paths, language versions, and snapshot hashes.'), [
 ('当前正文位于 docs/zh-CN 与 docs/en，报告位于 report/zh-CN 与 report/en；图表、JSON 和源码共享。docs/history/original 保存整理前原文，不是第二份当前正文。原始 assignment、第三方原文、既有核验和原始 JSON 不翻译或改写；邮件、模型和私有原文不纳入清单。','Current prose lives in docs/zh-CN and docs/en; reports live in report/zh-CN and report/en. Figures, JSON, and source are shared. docs/history/original preserves pre-reorganization text, not a second current body. Assignment originals, third-party text, existing verification, and raw JSON are not translated or rewritten; emails, models, and private originals are excluded.'),
 ('自动报告及附录由 render_bilingual_docs.py 从同一 stage_delivery_data.json 展示，双语正文由 documentation_content.py 维护。build_stage_report.py 仍使用原统计与核验，仅展示委托新生成器；plot_stage_report.py 不改数据或共享图。修改人工说明应编辑正文模板，重新生成会覆盖展示文件。','Reports and appendices are rendered by render_bilingual_docs.py from the same stage_delivery_data.json. Bilingual prose is maintained in documentation_content.py. build_stage_report.py retains its original statistics and validation, delegating only presentation to the new renderer. plot_stage_report.py does not alter data or shared figures. Edit prose templates rather than generated files, since regeneration overwrites presentation.'),
 ('本轮事实修正是状态与范围的澄清：早期 20/100 是计划、实际受控采样 10/30；早期 texture 未覆盖后来由 MEMORY001 补齐；NOT_RUN 不冒充当前状态；Adreno/有效逻辑 shape 等缺口不关闭。没有修改原有统计数值、阈值或计算契约。','Clarifications concern status and scope: early 20/100 was proposed, while controlled sampling uses 10/30; the earlier texture gap was later covered by MEMORY001; historical NOT_RUN is not current status; Adreno/effective logical-shape gaps remain open. No established numbers, tolerances, or computation contracts were changed.')], ['reading_guide','evidence_index','reproduction'])

